OL,3,GNEWSATwo MPs criticise approval of
OL,4,Amajor solar farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Conservative MPs have criticised
OL,7,Fthe approval of plans for one of the
OL,8,Fbiggest solar farms in the country.
OL,10,FStuart Andrew, the MP for Daventry and
OL,11,FSarah Bool, the MP for South
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire, claimed Green Hill
OL,13,FSolar Farm would take up farmland and
OL,14,Fchange the countryside.
OL,16,FThe development, which was approved on
OL,17,FThursday, will go ahead across about
OL,18,F2,965 acres (1,200 hectares) of land
OL,19,Fsouth and west of Wellingborough, north
OL,20,Fof Northampton and parts of
OL,21,FBuckinghamshire.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
