OL,3,GNEWSATwo MPs criticise approval of
OL,4,Amajor solar farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen speaking to Annabel Amos on BBC
OL,7,FNorthampton, Andrew said: "We're going
OL,8,Fto see villages in my constituency
OL,9,Fbeing surrounded by these huge solar
OL,10,Ffarms and it will change the landscape
OL,11,Fand... we will lose good arable land."
